{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1462.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"f2bb7d3c567027a5e0a4a245b1345a8dc0c6d487c26ec2918d6f95c2c5f79eaa","ja":"あっ、可奈。おはよー。\nねえねえ、この前の話、大丈夫だった？","zh":"啊，可奈。早上好～。\n我说我说，之前那件事没问题吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1462.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"068c1f10d3f6b9d3163fb165ad7326480ed1dbbe1a826e9ef9b09fd70f07c378","ja":"ワタシも心配だったヨー。\n友達に告白相手の人のこと、話せたノ？","zh":"我也很担心呢～。\n有跟朋友说告白对象的事吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1462.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"fa88353be095c5d28936db64e708d101b1006f5128476e5c5275958942b43d3c","ja":"そのことなんですけど……やっぱり友達に、\n相手がどんな人か、話してみようと思って。","zh":"关于那件事……我还是打算跟朋友说说，\n对方究竟是个什么样的人。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1462.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"ddb7af0856e6232d12b4857c18be4bc60b927bf9c54279a25f97dec32994e166","ja":"怒られちゃうかもしれないけど、知らなかったら\nダメだから……とにかく、話すだけでもって。","zh":"虽然可能会被骂，但不告诉你的话\n就不好了……所以无论如何，至少先跟你说一声。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1462.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"0048d35e17d2ec587c6dbcb45557827748271d7b0d891ff8f2196ea133ff4177","ja":"それで、さっき会ってきたんですけど。\n友達が、「やっぱり告白するのはやめた」って！","zh":"然后，我刚才去见她了。\n朋友居然说：“还是决定不去告白了”！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1462.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"33a28cbaf76cd2856faa6e6585e27fd226602390fd3f87f4347496743240f74b","ja":"ええっ！？　どうして急に！？","zh":"诶诶！？怎么这么突然！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1462.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"7fb073218a391f238747860bfeace0b32c9aa650b7408f29b2c09fbfce140a0d","ja":"昨日のテレビに出ていた男性アイドルに、\n一目惚れしちゃったらしくて……。","zh":"好像是对昨天电视上出现的男偶像\n一见钟情了的样子……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1462.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"66c74ef232bf9308ece57cc35ba87da33fdc77f015af0497a0fe0e482177b4e6","ja":"「そのアイドルを応援するのに忙しくなるから、\n彼氏は当分いらない」……だそうです！","zh":"“光是给那个偶像加油就够忙的了，\n暂时不需要男朋友”……她是这么说的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1462.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"2484534d5d37a677d10e7652e50ccdaa76c79ce6e245d12996d5c08ef2a9d22c","ja":"な、なんか急展開だネ……。\nカナ、あんなに悩んでたのに。","zh":"这、进展突然变得好快呢……\n明明可奈之前还那么烦恼的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1462.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"5ced5f54caf96dcd16c73c1719303a97ac082c030eaac46531fee1776859b065","ja":"でも、良かったんじゃないかな。可奈も余計な\nお世話かもしれないこと、しなくて済んだわけだし。","zh":"不过，这样也挺好吧。可奈也不用去做\n可能纯属多管闲事的事了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1462.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"cd514ddee351495f2a4e2ef08fa11aa96df9480d6d31ab645755568ca8b918f4","ja":"はい！　えへへ……友達が笑顔でハッピ～♪\n私もみんなもハッピーエンド～♪","zh":"好！嘿嘿……朋友露出笑容好开～心♪\n我也好大家也好都是大团圆结局～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
